    <config key="metadata">
        <entry key="description" type="xstring" value="Creates a bar plot visualizing the number of valid values in all selected columns.%%00010%%00010Columns can be grouped by sample type based on experimental design. Columns of the same sample type can be summarized using mean or median functions, or just visualized separately using with the same fill color if no summarization function is selected. It is also possible to show error bars (SD in case of mean summarization function, IQR in case of median). %%00010%%00010Statistical comparison between samples can be performed, parametric or non-parametric option needs to be chosen based on value distribution and sample size. For comparison between two sample groups, t-test or Mann-Whitney U test will be used. More than two sample groups will be first compared using ANOVA or Kruskal-Wallis test and in case of a significant result, pairwise comparisons using post-hoc TukeyHSD or Dunn's test will be performed. Sample design needs to be specified to be able to perform statistical comparison.%%00010%%00010================= %%00010%%00010Used programs and tools and their respective licenses at the time of the metanode creation. Version numbers and the licenses might differ based on your local installation. Please inspect your local installation and contact us if you can not locate your local version and or license terms. %%00010%%00010KNIME nodes (The KNIME nodes consists of the following GNU GPL 3.0 License. Licence terms are available here: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html) %%00010Python 3 (The Python consists of the following Python 3.6 License. Licence terms are available here: https://docs.python.org/3.6/license.html) %%00010R 4.2.0 (The R consists of the following GPL-3 License. License terms are available here: https://www.r-project.org/Licenses/GPL-3) %%00010%%00010The metanode was created in KNIME 4.7.7 running inside the docker image (https://hub.docker.com/r/cfprot/knime/), tag 4.7.7a. %%00010%%00010================= %%00010%%00010This version of metanode is available under the GNU GPL 3.0 License, unless stated otherwise. The full version of the license terms is available at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html. %%00010Version: 1.1.0 from 2025-06-25%%00010Contact person: Karolina Krystofova (karolina.krystofova@ceitec.muni.cz) %%00010More information can be found at https://github.com/OmicsWorkflows/KNIME_metanodes%%00010%%00010"/>
        <config key="inports">
            <config key="inport_0">
                <entry key="name" type="xstring" value="Input data"/>
                <entry key="description" type="xstring" value="Data to be processed"/>
                <entry key="index" type="xint" value="0"/>
            </config>
        </config>
